    "text": "9 hours ago On December 13, 2025, about 70 volunteers supporting the eighth annual Wreaths Across America event at the Mountain View Cemetery placed just over 1000 sponsored wreaths on the graves of veterans after a moving ceremony. It was the best year yet in terms of the number of volunteers and wreaths. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
